OL,3,GNEWSAWe met online - now we want to
OL,4,Abreak rowing record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women are attempting a 3,000 mile
OL,7,F(4,800 km) charity row across the
OL,8,FAtlantic after meeting for the first
OL,9,Ftime through an online advert.
OL,11,FOlivia Stocks, Megan Neely, and Jenna
OL,12,FVincent are competing in the 2026
OL,13,FWorld's Toughest Row in a
OL,14,Frecord-breaking endeavour to be the
OL,15,Fyoungest female team to row the
OL,16,FAtlantic.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
