OL,3,GNEWSAWe met online - now we want to
OL,4,Abreak rowing record
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeam member Jenna Vincent, 25, from
OL,7,FPoole in Dorset, is no stranger to
OL,8,Fundertaking athletic feats in the name
OL,9,Fof charity, having previously cycled
OL,10,Fthe length of the UK to raise money for
OL,11,Fthe Forest Holme Hospice.
OL,13,FThis year she is supporting them again,
OL,14,Ftackling the challenge in memory of her
OL,15,Fgodmother and her grandmother who spent
OL,16,Ftheir final days being cared for by the
OL,17,Fhospice.
